{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-041.md","record_count":27,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s041-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"காவலன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மகாராஜா...... பைத்தியத்திற்கு வைத்தியம் பார்ப்பதில் மகா கெட்டிக்காரனாம் ஒருவன்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்படியா!... வசந்தியிடம் அவனை அழைத்துப் போ!......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"காவலன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உத்திரவு!......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"காவலன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா—இவரை மகாராஜா தங்களிடம் அனுப்பினார். பெரிய வைத்தியராம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யார்?......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"போலி அக்ஷயன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் ஒரு வைத்தியன். என் பெயர்..... உக்ரசேனத் தூதன்... [புரிந்துகொண்டு]","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீளமான பெயர்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"போலி அக்ஷயன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அக்ஷயன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வசந்தி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அரசனை சரியானபடி ஏமாற்றியிருக்கிறீர்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"போ. அக்ஷ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்—என்னை யாரென்று யாராலும் கண்டுபிடிக்க முடியாது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி... நீர், வைத்தியரைப் போலவே......... நடித்துக் கொண்டிரும்—மற்றவைகளை நான் கவனிக்கிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"போ. அக்ஷ.","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நடிப்பதா பிரமாதம்!...ஓ!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வசந்தன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏய் வைத்தியா... மருந்து மருந்துண்ணு உயிரை வாங்குறே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d014","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வைத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதுக்குத்தான் முயற்சி பண்றேன் நடக்கலியே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d015","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எதுக்கு? உயிரை வாங்கவா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d016","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வைத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சே...சே...ஆண்டவன் புண்ணியத்திலே உங்க ஆயுசும் நீடிச்சு... இந்த வியாதியும் நீடிச்சு... அடியேனுடைய உத்தியோகமும் நீடிச்சு இருக்கணும்னு சதா எமதர்மன் பிரார்த்தனை பண்ணிக்கிட்டேயிருக்கேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d017","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வைத்தியா! எமனுக்கு வாகனம் என்னடா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d018","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எருமைக்கடா! அதனாலேதான் கெட்டவுங்ககிட்டேயெல்லாம் மெதுவா வாரான்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d019","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்... சந்தேகமில்லே... சந்தேகமில்லே—","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d020","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வைத்தியரே... என் ஆழ்ந்த அனுதாபங்களை முதலில் தெரிவித்துக்கொள்கிறேன்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d021","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வைத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன விகடரே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d022","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நிலையில்லா வாழ்வு... இதோ... புது வைத்தியர் வந்து விட்டார், வசந்தனுக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":66,"printed_page":65}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d023","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வைத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்போ நான்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d024","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"விக","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சற்றே விலகியிரும் பிள்ளாய்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d025","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏ, புது வைத்தியா... உனக்கு என்னென்ன தெரியும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d026","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"அட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மருந்து கொடுக்காமலேயே ஒரு முடிவு கட்டுவேன் வியாதியை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"},{"id":"manohara-s041-d027","scene_id":"manohara-s041","scene_ordinal":41,"transition_audit_id":"T041","speaker_label":"வச","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்படீன்னா... நீதான் புது வைத்தியன் சந்தேகமில்லே... ஏ பழைய வைத்தியா நீ ஓடு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":66}],"source_scene_file":"scene-041.md"}]}